# Link-checker exclusions for `npm run` CI link checking (lychee).
#
# Only permanently-legitimate entries belong here: a host that refuses automated
# requests, or a URL behind a login. A link that is genuinely broken goes in the
# report and gets fixed — never hidden here. Every entry states its reason, and an
# entry without one is a broken link somebody buried.

# Discord refuses invite lookups from non-browser clients (405/403) regardless of
# whether the invite is valid, so every community link would fail on every run.
https://discord\.gg/.*

# The Paperless-ngx documentation site answers 403 to every non-interactive
# client, a full browser User-Agent included, so the app page's two links to it
# fail on every run while being correct for a reader who clicks them.
https://docs\.paperless-ngx\.com/.*
